# Trim the build context.
#
# The vendored Emacs package tree (entrypoint/dotfiles/.emacs.d/elpa) is excluded
# from the image build: it stays vendored in git, but is NOT copied/baked into the
# image. `make shell` bind-mounts the vendored tree at /root/.emacs.d/elpa
# instead, and `make update-emacs-packages` refreshes it (see the Makefile). Only
# the elpa/ subtree is excluded -- the rest of .emacs.d (init.el,
# install-melpa-packages.el, helm.el, preferences.el) is still copied to /root.
entrypoint/dotfiles/.emacs.d/elpa

# build artifacts / caches
.git
# Patterns are anchored at the context root (unlike .gitignore), so a cache that
# appears below the root needs a leading **/.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/
